# Skyforge — Act IX: Aether's Edge (40 quests, Turn 5 part 1).
# TONE: Steampunk colonial. The Foreman crosses into other realms.
# Aether (peaceful sky-realm), Aerial Hell (corrupted opposite),
# Nullscape (End rework), Iron's Spellbooks academy, Reliquary
# trinkets, Cataclysm pre-bosses, Alex's + Mowzie's bestiary.
# THEME BIBLE: Exploration is prospecting. Every dimension is a
# survey expedition. Combat is opposition the Foreman handles.
